{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/972668-sidestep-death-gift","id":972668,"title":"Sidestep death (Gift)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-19T12:57:50-07:00","id":972668,"title":"Sidestep death (Gift)","content":"Is the &quot;Sidestep Death&quot; gift reflexive?<br /> For an example a certain garou gets attacked and receives an amount of damage that would kill him, does the gift activate itself reflexively and he's saved or he has to declare using the gift in the beginning of the scene (and when he's about to die it's activated)?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T13:31:32-07:00","id":972685,"title":"","content":"When the Garou receives the deathblow -- the Gift may be activated, the description of the Gift is pretty clear:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022 Sidestep Death (Level Four) \u2014 Legends say that when the first Silver Fang died, he was reborn with this Gift. The Fang simply sidesteps what would have become his deathblow. A lion-spirit teaches this Gift. System: Once per scene, the player may spend three Willpower points to evade a single attack that would inflict enough damage to place the Fang\u2019s health levels below Crippled (before soak). The Garou simply appears instantly at the nearest location not affected by the attack, which may be an inch, a mile, or even farther away. </div> </div> </div>It doesn't have to be declared at the beginning of the scene, if it takes time to activate that would defy the entire purpose of the Gift itself as it will be of little to no use. It's important to mention that no one can predict his death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11698-darko","name":"Darko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11698_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T13:37:58-07:00","id":972692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darko</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/972668-sidestep-death-gift?p=972685#post972685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When the Garou receives the deathblow -- the Gift may be activated, the description of the Gift is pretty clear:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> It doesn't have to be declared at the beginning of the scene, if it takes time to activate that would defy the entire purpose of the Gift itself as it will be of little to no use. It's important to mention that no one can predict his death.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright, thanks for the quick answer","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}